{"seq":15,"trial_id":"harness-zero-h2h-2026-11/zero-lean-opus-gbrain-mu-v03-dev2/sy-02-marrow-fieldworks-ticket-numbers/r1","wall_ts":"2026-11-07T10:58:23.985Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:10:00-05:00","args_digest":"2ba2ffdb5fe7bbd3b739f53e74b9306b9ba6f4134e1786dae08a5c05bfdc7c54","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DHARNES0001","text":"Tobias, here's what I found. One caveat first: neither source puts \"Marrow Fieldworks\" right next to a ticket number. Both call it \"the dealer account,\" so connecting the tickets to Marrow Fieldworks is my reading, and you should check it.\n\n**From Moss's note \"Central handoffs next week\" (2 Jan 2026)**\nThe note says Marrow Fieldworks changed hands on Mon 5 Jan 2026. Before that handoff, Hollis flagged two open tickets on \"Pree's dealer account\":\n- **#4409**: a timeout that keeps recurring on the Gatehouse Check-In report at the Salina North yard (Bay 4 and the west grain-bin apron, 06:00 flatbed intake).\n- **#4412**: a minor glitch in the driver SMS prompt when combine trailers are staged on unpaved overflow lots.\n\n**From #central-random (13 Oct, 09:27)**\n- **#8841**: you flagged this one yourself after Hollis asked about the tractor-bay alerts on \"Tobias's dealer account.\" At the Plains depots, West yard Door 2 is still double-booking when flatbeds check in early at the kiosk.\n\nI think \"Pree's dealer account\" before the handoff and \"Tobias's dealer account\" now are the same account, Marrow Fieldworks, but nothing I found says so directly.\n\n**Left out on purpose:**\n- **FR-882** (same Moss note): a feature request from Marrow *Agrisupply*, which is a different account.\n- **#88412**: Tansleigh Packaging.\n- **HR-409**: an internal payroll ticket.\n\nThere are no other Moss notes that mention Marrow Fieldworks, and nothing else in #central-random either. My search tool was running in a limited mode, though, so it could have missed something. If you can, check #4409 and #4412 in the CRM before the call. That note is from January, so they may have been closed since."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DHARNES0001","ts":"1791987000.000124"}}
